What does this program print?

```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);
function addItem(array $list, string $item): array
{
    $list[] = $item;
    return $list;
}
$a = ["tea"];
$b = addItem($a, "rice");
echo count($a), count($b), "\n";
```

Using the `makeCounter` function from the lesson (each call returns a closure that increments and returns its own `$count`, captured by reference), what does this print?

```php
$c1 = makeCounter();
$c2 = makeCounter();
$c1();
$c1();
$c2();
echo $c1() + $c2(), "\n";
```

What does this program print?

```php
<?php
function f(int $n): int
{
    return $n <= 1 ? 1 : f($n - 1) + f($n - 2);
}
echo f(6), "\n";
```

What does this program print?

```php
<?php
function joinAll(string $sep, string ...$parts): string
{
    return implode($sep, $parts);
}
echo joinAll("-", ...["a", "b"], ...["c"]), "\n";
```
